00:41:39.263 --> 00:41:42.633 align:start size:97% position:3%
that's the fourth one that
they found to be self-evident.

00:41:42.633 --> 00:41:45.035 align:start size:97% position:3%
That's probably the
scariest one for most people

00:41:45.035 --> 00:41:47.905
and especially in a
weird time like this

00:41:49.106 --> 00:41:50.941
let's talk about
that a little bit.

00:41:50.941 --> 00:41:55.145 align:start position:0%
- Sure, so I think the most
important thing to remember Dave

00:41:55.145 --> 00:41:59.583
is that America is a
revolutionary nation.

00:42:01.051 --> 00:42:04.522
And what I mean by that is we
were founded by a revolution.

00:42:05.756 --> 00:42:10.728
We created a new nation
de Novo out of nothing

00:42:10.728 --> 00:42:13.063
on a Tabula rasa.

00:42:14.598 --> 00:42:19.236 align:start size:97% position:3%
But built into the
principles of the declaration

00:42:19.236 --> 00:42:23.841
is the idea that whenever
any form of government

00:42:23.841 --> 00:42:27.711
becomes destructive of
those ends or purposes,

00:42:27.711 --> 00:42:29.246 align:start size:84% position:16%
which is the
protection of rights,

00:42:29.246 --> 00:42:32.616
the declaration says that
the people have the right

00:42:32.616 --> 00:42:37.187 align:start size:88% position:13%
to alter or abolish
that government, right?

00:42:37.187 --> 00:42:41.692
And that truth, and it
was meant to be a truth,

00:42:41.692 --> 00:42:45.162
not a truth specific to 1776,

00:42:45.162 --> 00:42:48.499
but a universal,
permanent truth.

00:42:48.499 --> 00:42:53.203 align:start size:84% position:16%
So it applied in 1840,
it applied in 1940

00:42:53.203 --> 00:42:56.273
and it will apply again in 2040.

00:42:56.273 --> 00:42:59.510 align:start size:84% position:16%
America is a
revolutionary nation.

00:42:59.510 --> 00:43:03.647 align:start size:84% position:16%
However, it's also
important to note that

00:43:03.647 --> 00:43:05.950
in "The Declaration
of Independence",

00:43:05.950 --> 00:43:08.485
the first word that appears

00:43:08.485 --> 00:43:12.022
after the fourth self-evident
truth, the revolution truth

00:43:12.022 --> 00:43:14.191
is the word prudent.

00:43:14.191 --> 00:43:16.727
And what that means,
the importance of that

00:43:16.727 --> 00:43:21.031
is that you can't
have some crazy guy

00:43:21.031 --> 00:43:24.234
living out in the woods of Idaho

00:43:24.234 --> 00:43:28.872 align:start size:97% position:3%
declaring war on the
American government, right?

00:43:28.872 --> 00:43:31.809
Revolutions are
dangerous things,

00:43:31.809 --> 00:43:33.410 align:start size:88% position:13%
and America's
Revolutionary Founders,

00:43:33.410 --> 00:43:35.746
they understood that,
it's a dangerous thing.

00:43:35.746 --> 00:43:40.217 align:start size:88% position:13%
And you can't try to
overturn your government

00:43:40.217 --> 00:43:42.052
for as the declaration says,

00:43:42.052 --> 00:43:45.356
"Light and transient causes."

00:43:45.356 --> 00:43:48.258 align:start size:81% position:19%
So Jefferson never
would have said

00:43:48.258 --> 00:43:51.629 align:start size:84% position:16%
that with the passage
of the Stamp Act,

00:43:51.629 --> 00:43:54.298 align:start size:88% position:13%
that would be
appropriate to overthrow

00:43:54.298 --> 00:43:55.833
the British government.

00:43:55.833 --> 00:43:57.568
But according to Jefferson,

00:43:57.568 --> 00:44:02.373
when you get the Sugar Act in
1764, the Stamp Act in 1765,

00:44:03.507 --> 00:44:06.043
the Declaratory Act
in '66 and then,

00:44:06.043 --> 00:44:10.147 align:start size:88% position:13%
the Townshend Acts in
1767, the Tea act in '73

00:44:10.147 --> 00:44:11.815
and then most importantly,

00:44:11.815 --> 00:44:16.820 align:start size:97% position:3%
the Coercive and Prohibitory
Acts in 1774 and '75.

00:44:18.489 --> 00:44:22.493 align:start size:97% position:3%
Jefferson says, "Look,
there is, there is clearly,

00:44:22.493 --> 00:44:25.062
"self-evidently a design."

00:44:25.062 --> 00:44:27.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's a word that
you see in the declaration

00:44:27.665 --> 00:44:29.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you see it in the
revolutionary literature.

00:44:29.833 --> 00:44:34.605
There is a design on the part
of British Imperial officials

00:44:34.605 --> 00:44:38.008
to enslave us, to deny us
our freedoms and rights.

00:44:38.008 --> 00:44:40.077
So if each of those laws

00:44:40.077 --> 00:44:41.645 align:start size:84% position:16%
had been passed by
the British government

00:44:41.645 --> 00:44:44.148
separated by 50 years each,

00:44:45.582 --> 00:44:47.351 align:start size:97% position:3%
there probably would have
been no cost for revolution.

00:44:47.351 --> 00:44:51.622 align:start size:88% position:13%
But when compacted in
an 11 or it just really,

00:44:51.622 --> 00:44:53.590
it was a 10 year period,

00:44:53.590 --> 00:44:57.628 align:start size:97% position:3%
Jefferson, John Adams,
George Washington even said,

00:44:57.628 --> 00:45:02.099
"Oh, look, these are
not just passing acts,

00:45:02.099 --> 00:45:03.901
"these are not mistakes

00:45:03.901 --> 00:45:05.969
"on the part of the
British parliament"

00:45:07.404 --> 00:45:11.975
or George the third, we can
clearly discern a pattern

00:45:13.077 --> 00:45:16.246 align:start size:84% position:16%
and that pattern
leads in one direction

00:45:16.246 --> 00:45:20.017
and that direction is slavery.

00:45:20.017 --> 00:45:22.920 align:start size:75% position:25%
So--
